WEBVTT

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:04.980
Don't you underestimate me!

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:17.740
Why...

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.770
Why are you doing this, Kusaka?

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:23.480
You practiced so hard!

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.320
Don't you care if you can't get to play soccer anymore?!

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.980
Kusaka-kun is scared...

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.810
He's scared that if he isn't strong, everyone will leave him...

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.760
I can tell...

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.270
Kusaka...

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:48.670
Now there's an interesting guy...

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:50.150
Yeah.

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:53.150
Kusaka!

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:54.970
I heard from Konoha.

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:57.660
What did she mean about you being strong to keep everyone from leaving you?

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:00.750
I'm sorry.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:01.990
Just stay out of it.

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:04.210
Kusaka...

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:08.920
<i>L-Let Sato-chan go!</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:11.880
<i>Don't act tough when you're really weak.</i>

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:15.260
<i>I-I'm not weak...</i>

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:16.590
<i>I'm not weak!</i>

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:18.800
<i>Dummy!</i>

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:20.380
<i>Let's get out of here.</i>

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:34.670
I made my choice... that I would get stronger!

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.550
The first half is over!

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:25.760
The quarterfinals between Japan's Inazuma Japan and Saudia Arabia's Shamshir meets half time with Shamshir in the lead at 1-0!

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:29.430
Do you even <i>want</i>  to play properly?!

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.230
I'm sorry.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:40.360
Tenma.

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:44.200
Let's keep Kusaka out of our plays in the second half.

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:49.480
We'll lose everything if he disrupts the game with his rough plays.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:52.040
But... I'm sure Kusaka understands that what he did was wrong!

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:56.920
For now, this is what we should do. Isn't it?

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:59.240
That would be our best option in our present condition.

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:00.880
It's an accurately-made decision.

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:04.480
Will that really be for the best?

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:06.100
We don't exactly have a choice, do we?

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.330
Wait!

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:10.460
I want all eleven of us to fight together!

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:13.850
I want to play soccer with <i>all</i>  of you guys!

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.070
Will that help us win?

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.410
Fine, then.

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:38.420
I can't allow myself to continue being a burden to the others.

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:47.200
Inazuma Japan will have to catch up with one point now.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:49.390
I look forward to seeing how they fare in the second half.

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:53.810
Those guys have a bomb that's ready to explode at any minute.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:57.230
Yeah, there are some guys who are like that.

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:58.680
You can do it!

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.110
They'll never know what hit them!

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:05.030
Rasheed!

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:17.210
Einsatz!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:19.540
What?!

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:22.570
Shindou steals the ball with lightning-fast movement!

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:23.300
Nozaki!

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:33.680
Tsurugi!

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:41.190
Batar intercepts and immediately runs to the frontline!

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.030
Everyone, move back!

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:47.530
Leave this to me!

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:49.070
Captain!

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:53.460
Move up, Matatagi!

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:54.160
Okay!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.500
I see.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.410
They're keeping me back to prevent me from going berserk.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.040
I'm sorry, Captain.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:04.380
But I also...

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:09.430
Go in!

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:12.450
Goalkeeper Sultan easily catches the ball!

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:15.140
Captain!

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:19.560
We'll show you the difference in our power.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:20.770
Do it!

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.220
Hissatsu tactics!

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:24.110
Giant Desert Sandstorm!

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:24.980
Yeah!

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:28.520
Giant Desert Sandstorm!

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:34.490
I'll stop them!

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:39.040
It's no use!

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:41.580
Once we plow towards you, no one can stop us!

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:43.740
Take this!

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.050
Oil Rush!

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:52.550
Goal!

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:56.810
Shamshir makes another point with their exceptionally destructive offense!

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:01.690
Arabia's lions, Shamshir...

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.690
They have a very powerful hissatsu tactics.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:11.820
We're just getting warmed up!

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.910
Let's focus on taking back a point first!

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:16.990
Now, the match resumes!

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:20.000
Everyone, move up!

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:26.090
Z Slash!

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:28.960
Tenma!

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:32.930
Sa'id steals the ball!

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:35.600
How about I give you one more?

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:37.180
I'll stop you!

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:38.180
Out of my way!

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:42.760
If you want it that badly, try and take it from me!

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:50.900
Damn it!

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:55.860
Don't rush, Kusaka!

00:07:55.860 --> 00:07:57.370
Look more carefully at how they're moving!

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.460
Well, well, are you okay there?

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:11.220
Don't tell me you're gonna say you broke a bone or three just from that.

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:15.590
Kusaka, no!

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:19.570
That's it.

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:20.600
Don't let it overpower you.

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:27.650
Nice pass!

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:32.220
Minaho clears it and prevents the danger!

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:35.450
Working hard at holding himself back, eh?

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.960
But we'll see how long that lasts.

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:53.760
Kusaka!

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.970
You're not going anywhere.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:00.010
Is this a formation meant to single out Kusaka?!

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:01.440
Those guys...!

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:07.480
Hey! Half-wit!

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:10.320
Here's that ball you wanted!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:15.600
Kusaka!

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:21.700
You make me laugh for thinking someone like you can win against us.

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:24.370
Weakling.

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:36.040
W-What?

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:39.430
You called me weak?!

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:45.850
Through pain, I'll show you how strong I am!

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.800
Kusaka, this isn't a fight!

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:56.950
You're playing soccer with your friends... With us!

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:59.020
I <i>am</i>  playing soccer!

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:00.320
No, you're not!

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:02.920
Soccer isn't a fight!

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:07.040
Even if you did beat him with your fists, that's not real strength!

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:09.710
Being strong is better than being weak!

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:12.170
I don't see anything strong about you right now!

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:13.670
What?!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:23.130
Kusaka-san, you're so strong!

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:25.470
I'm a huge fan of Kusaka-san!

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:29.810
When I show them how strong I am, everyone compliments me.

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:34.070
Not one of them leaves me...

00:10:35.060 --> 00:10:35.980
Kusaka...

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:37.530
But...

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:38.950
Kusaka!

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:44.730
What's this?!

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:47.450
A gang of thugs suddenly stomps onto the field!

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:49.520
Who are those guys?

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:54.240
The game has been stopped!

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:55.680
This is unprecedented!

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:58.470
Never before have I seen this in all my years as sports commentator!

00:10:58.680 --> 00:10:59.930
This is a nightmare!

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:01.510
Tenma...

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:02.930
Coach, aren't you going to stop this?

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:07.950
What do we do, Mizukawa-san?

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:10.350
There is nothing we can do.

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:12.650
Well, yes, but...

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:14.900
Nii-chan...

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:29.230
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:34.520
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:43.100
Hey, Kusaka-san, I hear you pushed my boys around yesterday.

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:45.430
I'm here to pay you back my thanks.

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:49.390
What are you talking about? Kusaka is-

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:53.310
I'm sorry, Captain. This is my problem.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:55.900
What's the matter? Aren't you gonna come at me?

00:11:56.330 --> 00:12:00.610
Did you turn into a weak wimp like the rumors say?

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:03.570
What did you just call me?

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:05.990
Kusaka!

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:12.750
What?!

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:13.710
Tenma!

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.480
They started fighting now.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:18.210
A barbaric lot.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:20.730
Kusaka...

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:21.920
Soccer...

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:25.090
Right now, you're playing soccer with us!

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:27.850
You think I can just hang back after he dissed me out like that?!

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:29.510
Kusaka...

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:32.840
Enough chatting, let's get on with it!

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:34.230
Weakling.

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:37.190
I am not weak.

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:41.190
I have gotten stronger.

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:49.780
I have to be strong.

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:51.810
I have to get stronger!

00:12:58.530 --> 00:13:00.210
Kusaka... No!

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:12.850
T-That's fine by me! Bring it the fuck on!

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:16.330
Kusaka!

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:18.770
Is this the strength you keep talking about?

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:23.280
Tenma...

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:26.980
This isn't real strength!

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:31.280
You've got to face what you're scared of without running away from it!

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:34.290
That's what a really strong guy would do!

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:40.440
<i>Kusaka-kun is scared...</i>

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:44.670
<i>He's scared that if he isn't strong, everyone will leave him...</i>

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:50.140
Even if you're scared of something, you have to face it!

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:52.890
Ryuu-chan!

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:56.020
S-Sato-chan!

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:08.500
Ryuu-chan, why are you putting yourself under so much pressure?

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:09.700
Because...

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:13.530
Because, you hate guys who are weak...

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:14.910
That's why I...

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:18.270
You were never weak back then, Ryuu-chan.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:23.400
Even though you were scared, you brought out the courage to face those bullies for me!

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:24.960
There was <i>nothing</i>  weak about that!

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:27.630
That's what I liked about you!

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:33.970
But that time, I didn't know what to do with myself and I ran away.

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:36.520
I have always wanted to apologize for that!

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:41.520
Sato-chan...

00:14:47.930 --> 00:14:49.280
Kusaka...

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:56.700
The sissy is crying.

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:01.710
What's the hold up? Come on!

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.210
Get out! {GTFO}

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:11.270
I-I think we should do as he says, Boss, yeah?

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:14.100
I'm not dealing with this. Let's go.

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:28.030
So this is what it means to be strong, huh?

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:31.570
I think I figured out 1 millimeter of how that feels like.

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:33.820
Captain.

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:36.790
I'm sorry for causing you all that trouble.

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:39.200
Come on, let's play soccer!

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:40.910
Yeah!

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:44.790
Friendship, what a load of bull.

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:48.130
Let's just get rid of these guys already.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.170
Yeah.

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:53.170
Now that the trouble has been avoided, the match resumes!

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:55.680
Shamshir moves up to obtain their third point!

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:58.600
The sissy is back again.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:01.390
Look upon the real me!

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:03.620
Again?

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:04.710
He's the same as before.

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:06.610
Ryuu-chan...

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:18.410
Kusaka!

00:16:20.550 --> 00:16:24.120
Kusaka steals the ball, moving like a whole other person from before!

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:24.920
What?!

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:29.240
Kusaka-kun is playing soccer properly!

00:16:29.240 --> 00:16:32.840
Looks like he's learned how to control himself.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:35.970
Don't get cocky!

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:37.300
We'll send you flying!

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:42.100
He's even learned how to adjust his power!

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:43.140
Wow!

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:45.600
Kusaka! Matatagi is free!

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:57.030
Parkour Attack!

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:04.250
Dry Blow!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.280
Goal!

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:13.800
With Kusaka's efforts that are beyond recognition, Inazuma Japan takes back a point!

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:15.600
You did it, Nii-chan!

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:16.630
Nice shoot!

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:20.320
Inazuma Japan is on the momentum! Their fierce attack can't be stopped!

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.310
Bicycle Sword!

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:31.690
Dry Blow!

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:35.710
Goal!

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:38.740
Inazuma Japan ties!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.200
Keep this up and we'll turn the score around!

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:44.500
This will finish it!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.710
God Wind!

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:57.720
Shamshir's do-or-die block reduces the force of the shoot!

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:01.220
Dry Blow!

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:06.740
Goalkeeper Sultan blocks that one!

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:08.580
Counterattack!

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:12.650
This is our last attack.

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:13.660
Let's go!

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:15.110
Hissatsu tactics!

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:17.370
Giant Desert Sandstorm!

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:18.070
Yeah!

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:21.850
Giant Desert Standstorm!

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:28.080
The next point will decide which team wins this match...

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.560
We have to block this somehow!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:35.300
Kusaka, don't! You'll get blown back!

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:37.800
I... will stop them!

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:46.350
Yes!

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:49.770
Kusaka barrels through that giant clash!

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:54.610
Brutal Head!

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:01.990
Dry Blow!

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:07.120
It's in!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:12.130
Inazuma Japan finally succeeds in a turnabout victory with Kusaka's Brutal Head!

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:17.380
The match is over!

00:19:19.060 --> 00:19:24.260
Inazuma Japan wins 3-2 against Shamshir and advances towards the semifinals!

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:30.680
Nice job, bandanna guy!

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:31.980
You were cool!

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:33.960
Ryuu-chan...

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:40.490
I was really anxious about it, but I'm genuinely glad I found the courage to come here today...

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:43.540
Kusaka.

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:45.530
You made the winning point!

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:48.170
That hissatsu shoot was amazing!

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:50.210
Let's keep this up and win the semifinals too!

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:57.170
Soccer is pretty nice.

00:19:58.400 --> 00:19:59.530
Right?!

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:00.630
Soccer's great, isn't it?!

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:01.980
Yeah!

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:06.600
In exchange, I want...

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:13.010
...for you to return me to this school, along with my friends who also got expelled because of me.

00:20:15.930 --> 00:20:18.610
I thought I was protecting my friends.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:22.960
But in reality, I was only protecting myself.

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:27.270
I did it because I was afraid that everyone would leave me.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.450
The semifinals are next!

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:38.070
With every game, they're all coming together.

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:42.070
And at the center of them all, at every time, it's Tenma.

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:43.970
Yeah...

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:46.470
That was a rather fun game.

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:54.230
Thank you for this meal!

00:20:56.260 --> 00:20:57.060
Delicious!

00:20:57.620 --> 00:20:59.480
Auntie, your curry is the best!

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:02.080
Eat up as much as you want!

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:05.260
There's plenty more where that came from!

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:06.950
Spicy!

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:12.580
My, my, Kusaka-kun. You're weak when it comes to spicy food, aren't you?

00:21:15.570 --> 00:21:17.960
No, I <i>love</i>  spicy foods!

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:20.230
Don't scare us like that...

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:24.800
Spicy!

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.450
But it tastes great!

00:22:52.850 --> 00:23:07.860
Next Episode

00:22:54.330 --> 00:22:56.140
A surprising training regime!

00:22:56.140 --> 00:22:59.100
A super-dimensional machine of which no one has heard of before comes down upon us!

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:01.690
Guys, we'll power up!

00:23:01.690 --> 00:23:04.270
